   "fix": "Rename to `IsPreconnected.edist_ne_top'` and state in the docstring that it is the `PseudoEMetricSpace` generalization of Mathlib's `IsPreconnected.edist_ne_top`; better still, upstream the generalization to Mathlib and delete this copy.",
